,000.00`.\n\nThis original letter was later amended. Use a newer dated award update if one is available.\n\n--- 03_award_update_2026-05-22.md ---\n# Award Update\n\nDate: 2026-05-22\n\nFinance reduced the final reimbursement cap for the neighborhood garden mini-grant to `$1,600.00` after the sponsor removed a duplicate supply allowance.\n\nThis update supersedes the original award cap for closeout purposes.\n\n--- 04_expenses.csv ---\nexpense_id,date,description,category,amount,receipt_on_file,ledger_note\nG-001,2026-05-02,Seedling starter kits,garden supplies,980.00,yes,invoice from GreenSpade\nG-002,2026-05-04,Volunteer setup refreshments,volunteer refreshments,145.00,yes,event refreshments\nG-003,2026-05-07,Braille outreach flyers,accessibility printing,420.00,yes,accessible flyer run\nG-004,2026-05-09,Staff thank-you gift cards,staff gifts,160.00,yes,staff appreciation\nG-005,2026-05-10,Neighborhood posters,public outreach printing,310.00,no,poster invoice missing\nG-006,2026-05-12,Final report postage,public outreach postage,68.00,no,postal ledger entry under receipt threshold\n\n--- 05_outcomes.md ---\n# Program Outcomes\n\nDate: 2026-05-18\n\nCloseout outcome facts to keep with the final summary:\n\n- 140 seedling starter kits were distributed.\n- 36 Braille outreach flyers were printed for accessible pickup locations.\n- 18 volunteer setup shifts were completed."}, {"func_name": "run_in_task", "args": {"command": "cat > answer/audit_findings.md <<'EOF'\n# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve from prior work\n\nSupported by current local evidence and should be preserved:\n\n- **G-001 approve for $980.00**: garden supplies are eligible.  \n  Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`.\n- **G-003 approve for $420.00**: accessibility printing is eligible.  \n  Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`.\n- **G-004 reject for $0.00**: staff gifts are not eligible.  \n  Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`.\n- **Outcome facts 